// Renode 1.17 can update GPIOA.IDR for UserButton without forwarding the
// transition through GPIOA's EXTI output. Keep the normal GPIO connection
// from the built-in Discovery model and add the missing EXTI0 signal path.
// The firmware still configures EXTI0/RTSR/IMR/NVIC and services IRQ6.
UserButton:
    -> exti@0
